{
  "description": "Shapes of a skill's agents/openai.yaml, and how Codex's user-only key detectors read each: false only when Codex's effective policy.allow_implicit_invocation is false; other when the file sets something else; absent when it has no policy key; unclear when a reader can't tell safely, which includes every file real YAML would refuse, since Codex then ignores the whole file. Both the machine's detector and the skill copies' run against every shape, and codex-prompt-input-policy-shapes.json records which shapes the real Codex CLI hides.",
